*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CLM0014
*> PURPOSE : INSURANCE CLAIMS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-01-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-12-07 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 483
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CLMNIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLM0014.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY CLM0014C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 WS-SIU             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> A=APPROVE I=INVESTIGATE D=DENY
    05 C-DN               PIC X VALUE 'A'.
        88 C-INVESTIGATE VALUE 'I'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 3000-AUTO-REPORT
    PERFORM 3100-CLAIM-FREQ
    DISPLAY "WS-SIU=" WS-SIU
    DISPLAY "C-DN=" C-DN
    STOP RUN.
3000-AUTO-REPORT.
    IF L-TY = 'A' AND PR-FLG = 'N' AND WS-CLAM > 5000.00
        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-SIU
        SET C-INVESTIGATE TO TRUE
    END-IF.
3100-CLAIM-FREQ.
    *> FREQUENT CLAIMANT
    IF WS-PCLM >= 4
        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-SIU
    END-IF.
